  "title": "Bûche de Noël",
  "description": "Bûche de Noël is a jelly-roll style chocolate cake with chocolate cream that&#39;s decorated to look like a yule log for an incredibly delicious Christmas dessert!",
  "authors": [
    "TYRARACHELE"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-11-25T16:54:26-05:00",
